          "id": "code-01-function",
          "answer": "```python\ndef run_length_encode(s: str) -> str:\n    if not s:\n        return \"\"\n    out = []\n    prev, count = s[0], 1\n    for ch in s[1:]:\n        if ch == prev:\n            count += 1\n        else:\n            out.append(f\"{prev}{count}\")\n            prev, count = ch, 1\n    out.append(f\"{prev}{count}\")\n    return \"\".join(out)\n```",
          "score": 1.0,
          "note": "OK"
        },
